+## Usage the afterModelResponse hook receives
+
+`afterModelResponse` is called once per user message, after the round loop exits ([chatOrchestrator.ts#L148](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.ts#L148)).
+
+- It receives the usage of every provider call the turn made, not the last round alone: the third argument is the total summed across the rounds that reported one, and a fourth argument carries the per-round breakdown, one entry per provider call in turn order ([validated by: reports usage summed across every provider call of a tool-driven turn, with the per-round breakdown](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestratorUsage.acceptance.test.ts#L64)).
